WEBVTT

00:03.432 --> 00:08.762
Hey, sorry about the noise back there. Let's

00:08.802 --> 00:13.311
bring the temple back down. We've got you.

00:18.765 --> 00:22.166
The weekend's here, we're putting on the shoes.

00:22.447 --> 00:25.348
We're laughing in the mirror, shaking off the

00:25.428 --> 00:28.709
blues. There's makeup on the counter, jackets

00:28.809 --> 00:31.491
on the bed. And you are right here with us,

00:31.791 --> 00:34.632
absorbing what is said. No need to change the

00:34.692 --> 00:37.833
subject, no need to clear the room. You're part

00:37.893 --> 00:41.315
of every secret that echoes in the gloom.

00:45.110 --> 00:49.012
No fragile egos standing in the way No heavy

00:49.112 --> 00:53.114
expectations ruining the day You are the safest

00:53.154 --> 00:56.836
harbor that we have ever known And you will never

00:56.896 --> 01:02.819
have to face the outside world alone Because you

01:03.140 --> 01:08.382
are one of the girls Yeah, you are riding with the

01:08.562 --> 01:13.884
flock We are skipping all the groomsmen. We are

01:14.044 --> 01:19.365
running down the clock. From the living room to

01:19.405 --> 01:23.566
the city lights, you are always on the list.

01:24.626 --> 01:29.387
You're the center of the circle. You're the one

01:29.487 --> 01:34.047
that can't be missed. Shoulder to shoulder as

01:34.107 --> 01:36.748
the chaotic world spins.

01:39.353 --> 01:42.687
You are one of the girls, and that is where the

01:42.747 --> 01:43.812
story begins.

01:46.670 --> 01:49.132
When the outside gets exhausting and the

01:49.192 --> 01:52.614
gentlemen are loud We bring you in the center and

01:52.654 --> 01:55.976
we separate the crowd You never have to prove a

01:56.056 --> 01:59.178
thing, you never have to fight Just roll into the

01:59.258 --> 02:02.920
circle and share the Friday night A man of honor

02:02.981 --> 02:05.602
sitting right exactly where he should The

02:05.662 --> 02:09.465
purest kind of loyalty completely understood

02:13.266 --> 02:17.107
No fragile egos standing in the way No heavy

02:17.207 --> 02:21.168
expectations ruining the day You are the safest

02:21.208 --> 02:24.849
harbor that we have ever known And you will never

02:24.929 --> 02:30.811
have to face the outside world alone Because you

02:30.851 --> 02:36.473
are one of the girls Yeah, you are riding with the

02:36.573 --> 02:42.127
flock We are skipping all the groomsmen. We are

02:42.147 --> 02:47.348
running down the clock. From the living room to

02:47.368 --> 02:51.870
the city lights, you are always on the list.

02:52.590 --> 02:57.131
You're the center of the circle. You're the one

02:57.151 --> 03:01.972
that can't be missed. Shoulder to shoulder as

03:02.032 --> 03:04.713
the chaotic world spins.

03:07.226 --> 03:10.568
You are one of the girls, and that is where the

03:10.628 --> 03:12.069
story begins.

03:15.711 --> 03:20.514
No filters, no walls, just absolute trust. When

03:20.534 --> 03:23.897
the evening calls, we're dropping the armor,

03:23.937 --> 03:27.079
we're feeling the grace. You're a permanent

03:27.139 --> 03:29.721
fixture in our safe space.

03:31.934 --> 03:37.117
Because you are one of the girls Yeah, you are

03:37.177 --> 03:41.679
